  "ruleText": "Mhp 104.02 Custodian of the Records. The executive director of the office of professional licensure and certification shall be the custodian of the board’s records. Plc 103 rules shall govern requests for information and access to records.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Mhp 100) #5675, eff 7-22-93, EXPIRED: 7-23-99\n\nNew. #7623, eff 1-10-02, EXPIRED: 1-10-10\n\nNew. #9852, eff 1-25-11; ss by #14182, eff 2-20-25",
